	"note": "Seed 961423591 (clone faults). C went offline knowing of body rows it had not read, so its canvas merge waited (body-not-caught-up). The user fixed a broken save, which removed a node and an edge, then deleted the file before the merge ran. On reconnect a peer's edit made it edit-beats-delete, and the restore brought the doc back with the removed records: the edit had never left the file. Fix: while the merge waits for the body, the planner keeps the file's edit on S as a held edit (reconcileContent keep, heldJob.ts keepWaiting), and the delete publishes it first. Focused test: reconciler.safety.test.ts \"held edit (body not caught up)\".",
